  "id": "correlate",
  "term": "correlate",
  "definition": "A correlate is a feature that is linked with or tends to occur alongside another feature. In this biological context, it refers to a brain characteristic, such as a structural pattern, that is associated with a psychological or psychiatric manifestation.",
